# Base system + kernel (BIOS boot, serial console for headless debugging).
alpine-base
linux-lts
e2fsprogs
dosfstools
# Kiosk session: cage is a Wayland kiosk compositor, seatd hands it the DRM and
# input devices, mesa-dri-gallium provides the GPU drivers, udev populates /dev.
chromium
cage
seatd
# Chromium's software GL lives in subpackages that are not dependencies: without
# chromium-swiftshader the SwiftShader Vulkan ICD is absent, SwANGLE cannot
# initialize, and Chromium kills the browser outright when its GPU process keeps
# failing ("GPU process isn't usable. Goodbye.") -- the box then looped between a
# black screen and a restarted session. chromium-lang is what makes the
# launcher's --lang=hu reach Chromium's own error pages and dialogs (the
# renderers otherwise ran with --lang=en-US).
chromium-swiftshader
chromium-lang
# Alpine's cage links Xwayland and refuses to start without the binary.
xwayland
udev
mesa-dri-gallium
xkeyboard-config
ttf-dejavu
# Clock: boxes lose power with no clean shutdown, chrony re-syncs at boot.
chrony
tzdata
